WEBVTT

00:00:52.687 --> 00:00:55.179
Arusu and the others went
to Wizard Kingdom and were...

00:00:55.289 --> 00:00:57.189
...saved by the
appearance of the wizards.

00:00:57.291 --> 00:01:00.261
They were somehow able to
go back to Witch Heaven.

00:01:01.095 --> 00:01:04.121
Sheila was asked discreetly
by the grand master...

00:01:04.232 --> 00:01:08.430
...to search for the double-crossing
witch who uses dark magic.

00:01:09.337 --> 00:01:14.298
Then Arusu, Eva, and Sheila
formed the Magical Girl Squad.

00:01:15.576 --> 00:01:19.171
But shortly after that,
Arusu disappeared.

00:02:47.201 --> 00:02:50.569
Tweeny Witches

00:02:55.109 --> 00:02:59.569
Interdimensional Sea

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:11.755
Look into the mirror.

00:03:26.774 --> 00:03:29.402
I'm in front of the mirror.

00:03:31.178 --> 00:03:35.081
But you were never aware
of my presence.

00:03:44.926 --> 00:03:48.658
| want you to feel my pain.

00:03:51.966 --> 00:03:56.028
| want you to share your joy with me.

00:03:59.006 --> 00:04:00.565
Because I...

00:04:01.876 --> 00:04:03.844
I'm your mirror.

00:04:10.918 --> 00:04:14.786
Because you're my mirror.

00:04:16.357 --> 00:04:20.055
Because I'm your...

00:04:40.815 --> 00:04:41.748
Huh?

00:04:44.819 --> 00:04:46.583
So you're human, eh?

00:04:46.654 --> 00:04:47.212
What?

00:04:50.057 --> 00:04:52.992
Um... who are you?

00:04:53.427 --> 00:04:55.088
My name is Jannu.

00:04:55.262 --> 00:04:57.629
Sheila asked me to take care of you.

00:04:58.632 --> 00:04:59.861
Sheila?

00:05:01.235 --> 00:05:03.897
At first, I didn't feel like listening
to a goody-goody girl like her...

00:05:04.005 --> 00:05:07.373
But she told me you're human.
So I had no choice but to help you.

00:05:08.109 --> 00:05:10.100
What did Sheila tell you to do?

00:05:10.311 --> 00:05:11.904
| mean what is this place?

00:05:12.013 --> 00:05:13.378
The Interdimensional Sea.

00:05:13.481 --> 00:05:18.043
Oh, so we're on a ship.
No wonder it's shaking a lot...

00:05:18.452 --> 00:05:20.216
Interdimensional Sea?

00:05:21.922 --> 00:05:25.756
We're inside a ship named Ludens.
We're on our way to the Human Realm.

00:05:25.893 --> 00:05:30.455
So basically, I was asked by Sheila
to put you on this ship.

00:05:30.765 --> 00:05:33.166
While you were snoring
like a lion that is.

00:05:33.267 --> 00:05:35.702
Listen up! Here's an announcement!

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:39.332
The ship has left the
Magical Realm and is probably...

00:05:39.473 --> 00:05:41.669
...on its way to the Human Realm.

00:05:41.776 --> 00:05:43.608
I'd say if you sleep 200...

00:05:43.711 --> 00:05:46.908
...maybe 300 times, then
you'll reach the Human Realm.

00:05:47.214 --> 00:05:50.775
As you may know, the ship is
operated by a magical robot!

00:05:50.885 --> 00:05:53.582
You people don't have
to worry about anything!

00:06:00.461 --> 00:06:04.523
Hold it! If they see you,
then they'll know you're a stowaway!

00:06:05.499 --> 00:06:08.525
We're going to tell you people
what happens when you get...

00:06:08.636 --> 00:06:10.661
...to the Human Realm!

00:06:10.738 --> 00:06:11.728
Here we go!

00:06:11.839 --> 00:06:15.070
Mileth and Miletis present
"A Guide for the Human Realm"!

00:06:15.176 --> 00:06:16.041
Yay!

00:06:16.177 --> 00:06:17.838
Guide for the Human Realm?

00:06:17.912 --> 00:06:21.109
Now the Human Realm is a place where...

00:06:21.215 --> 00:06:25.675
...creatures called humans reside.
Plus they can't use magic.

00:06:25.986 --> 00:06:29.820
They even have oceans,
sunlight, and parks.

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:33.121
Once you get to the Human Realm,
you can't use magic at all.

00:06:33.227 --> 00:06:35.821
Plus you can never
wear black robes again.

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:38.598
This is the entrance to the Human Realm!

00:06:38.699 --> 00:06:41.999
Hey! That's the crow statue!
That's the arrival point?

00:06:42.169 --> 00:06:43.694
Don't ask me.

00:06:43.804 --> 00:06:48.037
Besides, you're a human.
You just might know more than we do.

00:06:48.142 --> 00:06:50.770
Well, I know that statue...

00:06:50.911 --> 00:06:54.848
But I don't think anyone in the
Human Realm knows what that stands for.

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:57.947
What's wrong?

00:06:59.887 --> 00:07:02.549
| felt as if someone was calling for me.

00:07:03.390 --> 00:07:07.827
How do you expect us to be happy
without magic? It's not possible!

00:07:07.962 --> 00:07:08.905
That's right! That's right!

00:07:08.929 --> 00:07:10.419
That's right! That's right!
Now wait a minute!

00:07:10.531 --> 00:07:11.191
Hey!

00:07:11.432 --> 00:07:15.062
All I hear from you people is
just whining and complaining.

00:07:15.569 --> 00:07:16.331
You...

00:07:16.804 --> 00:07:20.069
Of course there's happiness.
There's no place like home.

00:07:20.174 --> 00:07:23.109
There are great things
about the Human Realm!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:24.143
What?

00:07:24.445 --> 00:07:25.935
Ah...

00:07:28.015 --> 00:07:29.608
She's a human?

00:07:29.984 --> 00:07:32.112
She's a human all right.

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:33.949
Human?

00:07:36.724 --> 00:07:38.749
Yes, that's right!

00:07:38.859 --> 00:07:42.227
My name is Arusu, and I'm a human!

00:07:42.696 --> 00:07:45.495
Why is a human child on this ship?

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:49.495
If she's a human, then why is she
wearing apprentice witch robes?

00:07:51.939 --> 00:07:52.735
Again?

00:08:04.084 --> 00:08:05.848
What the heck just happened?

00:08:05.953 --> 00:08:06.997
Why is the ship not moving?

00:08:07.021 --> 00:08:08.580
Why is the ship not moving?
That's the reason why!

00:08:08.689 --> 00:08:10.657
There's something in the back!

00:08:22.403 --> 00:08:24.235
What? Come on!

00:08:24.371 --> 00:08:26.100
| wanna see it too!

00:08:26.173 --> 00:08:28.665
Here comes another one!

00:08:35.216 --> 00:08:38.049
What's that? What is that thing?

00:09:07.081 --> 00:09:09.846
| am the pirate witch Lennon.

00:09:10.284 --> 00:09:12.082
That's the one!

00:09:12.353 --> 00:09:12.911
What?

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:16.415
| have just taken control of this ship.

00:09:17.925 --> 00:09:19.120
Acquaintance?

00:09:19.226 --> 00:09:22.685
Not that I know of. But that's
the one who kept calling me...

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:27.961
If you don't want me to sink your ship,
then hand over your food and supplies.

00:09:28.669 --> 00:09:30.933
All our food and supplies?

00:09:31.505 --> 00:09:35.271
If we do that, then we'll starve to death
before we reach the Human Realm.

00:09:35.376 --> 00:09:39.609
I think it's impossible
to sink this ship.

00:09:39.713 --> 00:09:40.544
Right?

00:09:49.189 --> 00:09:52.750
Listen to me. You people think
that going to the Human Realm...

00:09:52.826 --> 00:09:54.988
...will cause lots of misfortune.

00:09:55.095 --> 00:09:57.063
But you are very much mistaken.

00:09:57.498 --> 00:09:58.522
Mistaken?

00:09:58.999 --> 00:10:02.867
Those who stayed in the Magical Realm
are the unfortunate ones.

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:06.565
| know you're trying to make this up!
You sound very fishy!

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:10.208
The Magical Realm is going
to be destroyed in due time.

00:10:10.311 --> 00:10:12.075
The Magical Realm?

00:10:12.413 --> 00:10:13.574
Destroyed?

00:10:14.014 --> 00:10:17.348
In other words, the witches
and warlocks that stay there...

00:10:17.451 --> 00:10:19.351
...will eventually die.

00:10:19.887 --> 00:10:24.051
But you people can flee
to the Human Realm.

00:10:24.625 --> 00:10:26.821
| mean, is this all true?

00:10:27.628 --> 00:10:28.638
I'm positive.

00:10:28.662 --> 00:10:30.096
I'm positive.
No!

00:10:30.931 --> 00:10:32.194
| see...

00:10:33.167 --> 00:10:35.932
That's why Sheila sent me away...

00:10:39.139 --> 00:10:41.005
Then what about Eva?

00:10:42.042 --> 00:10:43.510
What about the fairies?

00:10:43.977 --> 00:10:45.376
What about the magic?

00:10:46.880 --> 00:10:49.349
Are you saying that
everything will be gone?

00:10:51.618 --> 00:10:53.746
You have until daybreak.

00:10:54.221 --> 00:10:57.748
If you don't hand over your
food and supplies by daybreak...

00:10:57.825 --> 00:11:00.021
...I will sink your ship without mercy.

00:11:00.327 --> 00:11:04.457
| have sunk many ships
heading to the Human Realm.

00:11:04.932 --> 00:11:06.866
The Magical Realm will be gone.

00:11:06.967 --> 00:11:11.063
It's best to take your chances
and head over to the Human Realm.

00:11:11.905 --> 00:11:16.069
If we hand over all our food
and supplies, then we'll...

00:11:17.111 --> 00:11:20.081
What should we do?

00:11:33.093 --> 00:11:36.085
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.634 --> 00:11:45.094
The Pirate Lennon

00:11:46.407 --> 00:11:48.671
You have until daybreak.

00:11:48.809 --> 00:11:52.268
If you don't hand over your
food and supplies by daybreak...

00:11:52.379 --> 00:11:54.074
I will sink your ship without mercy.

00:11:54.615 --> 00:11:55.639
Heave-ho...

00:11:56.116 --> 00:11:57.413
So heavy...

00:11:57.518 --> 00:11:58.815
Heave-ho...

00:12:00.154 --> 00:12:04.057
We're giving away our food and
supplies to reach the Human Realm?

00:12:04.224 --> 00:12:05.885
| don't think so.

00:12:05.993 --> 00:12:07.461
What do you mean?

00:12:08.495 --> 00:12:10.486
Just say it! We don't have much time!

00:12:10.564 --> 00:12:13.898
Then I'll make an announcement.

00:12:14.168 --> 00:12:15.636
Drumroll...

00:12:16.303 --> 00:12:17.464
Tada!

00:12:18.639 --> 00:12:21.006
We're going back to the Magical Realm.

00:12:22.142 --> 00:12:25.601
What? What's with all the sighs?

00:12:25.712 --> 00:12:28.682
Even if we go back, our realm
is going to be destroyed soon!

00:12:28.749 --> 00:12:30.410
You don't know that!

00:12:30.517 --> 00:12:33.714
Are you saying that the realm
being destroyed is all a lie?

00:12:34.655 --> 00:12:37.784
We have magic, you know.

00:12:38.225 --> 00:12:38.885
Magic?

00:12:38.959 --> 00:12:39.551
Right.

00:12:39.693 --> 00:12:43.687
If we use our magic, then we might
be able to prevent this destruction.

00:12:43.764 --> 00:12:44.788
You...

00:12:45.766 --> 00:12:47.860
If that is possible,
then the grand master...

00:12:47.968 --> 00:12:52.599
You know something? Magic actually
means performing a miracle.

00:12:53.106 --> 00:12:55.768
Jeez! Don't you even know that?

00:12:55.943 --> 00:12:59.504
Then why don't you perform
that miracle of yours right now?

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:00.590
Then I'll believe you...

00:13:00.614 --> 00:13:03.174
Then I'll believe you...
You said you'll believe me, right?

00:13:03.283 --> 00:13:05.047
That's impossible.

00:13:05.152 --> 00:13:07.780
Who in here can use magic anyway?

00:13:08.889 --> 00:13:12.450
That's right.
The ones on the ship are all...

00:13:14.228 --> 00:13:15.320
You can?

00:13:15.496 --> 00:13:16.361
Yeah.

00:13:16.797 --> 00:13:20.290
But you're a human.
Humans can't possibly use magic...

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:22.892
That's what you think. But you see...

00:13:23.003 --> 00:13:26.769
| can use magic as long as
| believe with all my heart.

00:13:26.874 --> 00:13:28.968
Believe with all your heart?

00:13:29.343 --> 00:13:32.438
Listen. If I'm able to create
a miracle by using magic...

00:13:32.546 --> 00:13:34.810
...we're heading back
to the Magical Realm.

00:13:36.316 --> 00:13:37.579
Hey!

00:13:41.421 --> 00:13:42.889
Is everything ready?

00:13:42.956 --> 00:13:45.550
What? I can't hear you!

00:13:46.026 --> 00:13:48.120
| said is everything ready?

00:13:48.228 --> 00:13:52.290
Man, I can't hear anything!
I'm heading over there!

00:13:52.432 --> 00:13:54.662
Oops-a-daisy. Wow!

00:13:55.836 --> 00:13:56.860
She's flying!

00:13:56.970 --> 00:13:58.995
A human is flying!

00:13:59.206 --> 00:14:02.107
What did I tell you?
If you believe with all your heart...

00:14:02.209 --> 00:14:04.177
...then anyone can fly!

00:14:05.112 --> 00:14:06.671
There.

00:14:07.648 --> 00:14:11.516
Why? Why is a witch capable of
using magic on board that ship?

00:14:12.686 --> 00:14:14.711
Sucks for you!

00:14:16.156 --> 00:14:18.523
No way! There are two of you?

00:14:18.659 --> 00:14:20.252
Not just two.

00:14:22.095 --> 00:14:23.153
What?

00:14:23.964 --> 00:14:25.591
What's going on?

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:30.534
What happened to you and your miracles?
You're going to lose!

00:14:30.637 --> 00:14:32.799
No time to be saying things like that!
Help me out!

00:14:32.906 --> 00:14:34.237
You too!

00:14:34.441 --> 00:14:37.604
Listen. No matter what happens,
don't let go!

00:14:39.713 --> 00:14:40.612
We did it!

00:14:44.017 --> 00:14:46.611
What? You're not witches?

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:49.179
The real witch is somewhere else!

00:14:49.289 --> 00:14:50.256
Roger!

00:14:53.594 --> 00:14:58.361
| took it easy on you since
you were a witch. But not anymore!

00:15:00.734 --> 00:15:02.566
Take that!

00:15:06.773 --> 00:15:08.366
Who the heck...

00:15:09.176 --> 00:15:11.167
...are you supposed to be?

00:15:16.383 --> 00:15:18.511
Hey, are you okay?

00:15:20.387 --> 00:15:25.120
| didn't know there was a witch
on that ship who could use magic.

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:30.257
Then you're the real...

00:15:31.164 --> 00:15:33.690
Pirate Lennon.

00:15:35.168 --> 00:15:38.604
So it was you all along.

00:15:42.376 --> 00:15:45.038
Hey! What is the meaning of this?

00:15:45.946 --> 00:15:48.005
The weak will not survive.

00:15:48.515 --> 00:15:50.745
That's the way of the seal!

00:15:51.818 --> 00:15:54.788
Hey! What are you going to do?

00:15:57.824 --> 00:16:01.089
All this time. I was waiting for you.

00:16:03.864 --> 00:16:08.062
I had no choice but to live as a pirate
on the Interdimensional Sea.

00:16:08.268 --> 00:16:10.168
You're my hope.

00:16:10.337 --> 00:16:14.296
You've gotta be kidding me!
I'm going back to the Magical Realm!

00:16:18.845 --> 00:16:20.279
We're saved?

00:16:20.614 --> 00:16:22.878
We're saved, right?

00:16:23.083 --> 00:16:24.994
But Arusu is still on the ship!

00:16:25.018 --> 00:16:26.486
But Arusu is still on the ship!
Can't help it.

00:16:26.586 --> 00:16:29.715
She's the one who said something
about creating miracles.

00:16:29.823 --> 00:16:31.882
| was asked to look after her!

00:16:32.726 --> 00:16:36.390
Hey. These brooms all have
gryphon feathers in them, right?

00:16:36.496 --> 00:16:37.258
Jannu?

00:16:37.698 --> 00:16:41.862
She could fly. How could we not fly?
We're supposed to be witches!

00:16:43.804 --> 00:16:47.707
If you head over to the Human Realm,
you'll regret it for the rest of your life!

00:16:50.444 --> 00:16:51.570
You all...

00:16:57.784 --> 00:17:00.378
| don't have time to
stay here like this!

00:17:00.721 --> 00:17:02.314
| have to go!

00:17:03.223 --> 00:17:07.023
But you people were driven out
of the Magical Realm. No?

00:17:07.127 --> 00:17:09.118
My friends are waiting for me!

00:17:12.566 --> 00:17:13.658
Friends?

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:16.497
| also have to protect the magic!

00:17:16.603 --> 00:17:18.571
| made a promise!

00:17:22.175 --> 00:17:25.873
We're going back with you!
Back to the Magical Realm!

00:17:26.913 --> 00:17:28.938
Jannu! Everyone!

00:17:29.516 --> 00:17:30.779
This can't be!

00:17:30.884 --> 00:17:33.854
There weren't supposed to be
any witches who can use magic!

00:17:33.954 --> 00:17:35.285
Sorry about that!

00:17:35.388 --> 00:17:38.653
I didn't know flying in the air
would feel this good!

00:17:38.859 --> 00:17:39.758
Stop it!

00:17:41.928 --> 00:17:44.693
You are going back to the Magical Realm?

00:17:44.798 --> 00:17:47.631
But I still haven't used any magic
that would create a miracle.

00:17:47.701 --> 00:17:49.465
You did create a miracle.

00:17:49.536 --> 00:17:50.025
Huh?

00:17:50.804 --> 00:17:54.331
You used magic that
moved everyone's hearts.

00:17:54.541 --> 00:17:56.942
Magic is great!

00:18:00.547 --> 00:18:02.106
This is great!

00:18:06.052 --> 00:18:09.716
| can't believe that a human would
make us realize the value of magic.

00:18:10.757 --> 00:18:14.455
But, Arusu, don't you have to
go back to the Human Realm?

00:18:14.561 --> 00:18:19.465
To be honest with you, I thought
the Human Realm was pathetic.

00:18:20.167 --> 00:18:24.866
But after being away, I realized that
it isn't that bad of a place after all.

00:18:25.605 --> 00:18:29.041
But I'll postpone my trip home for now.
We need to take care of business!

00:18:29.176 --> 00:18:31.975
Yeah. Let's go back
to the Magical Realm.

00:18:32.312 --> 00:18:35.680
We have to go back and protect
the magic and our friends!

00:18:35.749 --> 00:18:36.477
Yeah!

00:18:37.150 --> 00:18:40.984
Don't you ever attack ships
heading to the Human Realm!

00:18:41.555 --> 00:18:42.147
Hey.

00:18:42.856 --> 00:18:45.484
You were calling out to me, right?

00:18:45.926 --> 00:18:48.827
You were always calling out to me. Why?

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:53.295
You're my mirror.

00:18:54.534 --> 00:18:57.026
That's why I called out to you.
All this time.

00:18:57.137 --> 00:18:58.195
Let's go!

00:18:59.439 --> 00:19:01.134
Let me stay on this ship!

00:19:02.742 --> 00:19:05.143
| was always alone.

00:19:05.779 --> 00:19:08.214
You're going to stay with me and...

00:19:08.381 --> 00:19:10.941
...wander around this
Interdimensional Sea?

00:19:16.122 --> 00:19:16.953
I---

00:19:19.392 --> 00:19:22.657
Hey, let's go back to the
Magical Realm together!

00:19:26.166 --> 00:19:28.260
| understand how you feel.

00:19:28.902 --> 00:19:31.769
If I couldn't find any friends
in the Magical Realm...

00:19:31.872 --> 00:19:33.897
...then I would've been just like you.

00:19:33.974 --> 00:19:36.568
I'm sure everyone feels sad
when they're alone.

00:19:42.015 --> 00:19:43.483
Stop crying!

00:19:43.650 --> 00:19:46.779
I'm supposed to be your mirror, right?

00:19:48.154 --> 00:19:50.680
I don't cry no matter what happens.

00:19:53.827 --> 00:19:55.921
You don't believe me, do you?

00:19:56.363 --> 00:20:00.425
That I'm your mirror.

00:20:00.834 --> 00:20:01.426
What?

00:20:17.550 --> 00:20:25.514
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:25.692 --> 00:20:33.692
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:34.935 --> 00:20:42.935
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:44.144 --> 00:20:49.708
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:49.816 --> 00:20:54.083
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:54.821 --> 00:20:59.054
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:59.159 --> 00:21:03.756
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:03.964 --> 00:21:09.130
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:09.235 --> 00:21:12.296
Let's hope it does.

00:21:13.873 --> 00:21:18.367
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:18.478 --> 00:21:20.970
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:21.081 --> 00:21:29.081
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:35.990
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:36.096 --> 00:21:40.294
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
